    - Name: tooltip
      Entry: 1
      Data: World-space distance from the camera excluded from self-shadowing checks.
        Should be a bit longer than your longest handheld prop (e.g. the flashlight)
        as held at arm's length. Increase this if a held light still shows a self-shadow
        blob.
